    <title>103期：送礼手册：送啥都行，别送碧桂园</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad5d52d641ef406308de6ca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad5d52d641ef406308de6ca</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>平日不知道如何送礼的朋友，这期有辐了！送礼怎么把东西送进别人心里，送到别人手里，这集有不少你能用上的干货！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltt0Y7vLbE4U1BHYC4mPeB9ZE2um.JPG"><p><span>朋友们，如果您有任何投稿，现在就可以给俺们进行投稿了！可以点击下方链接进行投稿！</span></p><p><a href="https://v.wjx.cn/vm/wFBUCgE.aspx" data-url="https://v.wjx.cn/vm/wFBUCgE.aspx"><span>v.wjx.cn</span></a></p><p><span>平日送礼，日常贿赂，你有什么高见？你收到过什么特殊的礼物么？评论区里聊聊！</span></p><p><strong><span>———————————</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本期中您将听到：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">00:06:06</a> 暴龙收到的最好的礼物，当然不是皮鞭啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">00:15:48</a> 阿超来送你们一条以防万一的经验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">00:26:35</a> 《标题》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">00:38:15</a> 孙郁给脱口秀观众最好的礼物，就是别出现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">00:42:50</a> 礼物送这个，MAN, WHAT CAN I SAY.</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">00:47:00</a> 这个礼物，来无名就能看到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">00:56:24</a> 礼物，主打一个可回收</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3702">01:01:42</a> 大学男生，可能收到的最好的礼物了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4210">01:10:10</a> Scott的咖啡馆故事更新，这个男人没救了</span></p><p><span>同场加映：</span></p><p><span>👇孙郁同款龙塌👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvzk9Hwt6NZeCpBshfsHb0FsyhuZ.png"><p><span>👇阿超收到的最好的礼物👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJzqIgjdtb-RJ76-nMM2k33k30Z.jpg" alt=""><p><span>👇Scott想请女孩吃的东西👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFIW-yO-D8OMHN7rL8mmJ8FGpDK.png"><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>暴龙（</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/627605d60000000010006ad5?xsec_token=ABEloIeYnBU4wVXtowStM82dJ-4nBGUU174d97KWHkfrE%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/627605d60000000010006ad5?xsec_token=ABEloIeYnBU4wVXtowStM82dJ-4nBGUU174d