    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>8月，在别人的暑期里聊聊已经和我们渐行渐远的暑假！竟然有人从小就讨厌过暑假你敢信？听完了就信咧！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiMMcdowjhO2KpKUOy8oPsXkBjhS.JPG"><p><span>在这个暑期的后半场里，听听别人记忆里的暑假和你有何不一样。</span></p><p><strong><span>———————————</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本期中您将听到：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a> 相宜高考后立刻就想变黄毛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">00:06:48</a> 惊！暴龙竟然上过高中？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">00:08:45</a> 我追求的不是自由，是自由的念头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">00:10:38</a> 咱们播客能不能就好好聊天！别整抖音字幕那套！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">00:15:32</a> 车洪君一眼就能看出别人是不是好的喜剧演员</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">00:16:21</a> 四年级后，超超就没有暑假了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">00:26:39</a> 想减肥的现在就去找猴子姐！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">00:34:14</a> 一句话向别人推荐《还珠格格》 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">00:41:56</a> 要打工就去找真正的资本家！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">00:53:10</a> 这个暑假工你们肯定都没打过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3745">01:02:25</a> 我来补课，但是孩子真教不会啊！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3986">01:06:26</a> 谁说大专不能做家教？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4464">01:14:24</a> 两人组合做家教，教不会还打不过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5082">01:24:42</a> 找英语家教的来这里</span></p><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>孙郁（小红书号：wumingxiju）</span></p><p><span>车洪君（小红书号：车洪君）</span></p><p><span>超超（小红书号：155233303）</span></p><p><span>暴龙</span></p><p><span>相宜</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><h1><span>Your Summer Dream - 山下達郎</span></h1><p><strong><span>出品：</span></strong></p><p><span>南京无名喜剧</span></p><p><strong><span>微信搜索baituole2，加入听友群！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（加入光荣的进化吧！）</span></strong></p><p></p>]]></description>
