    <title>94期：我想做我妈妈的妈妈 | Rachel47&amp;魔仙岛岛主</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a702669ab3a91c24a0ee41a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a702669ab3a91c24a0ee41a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期，Rachel47 时隔一年回到南京，本期更有大家的老朋友魔仙岛岛主和大家一起分享和自己妈妈的故事！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/njreDoLamCmg99bNpD4h4_zpClpp.jpg"><p><span>本期欢笑满满，欢迎听众和我们一起进入这个一个半小时的奇妙旅程！</span></p><p><strong><span>———————————</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本期中您将听到：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a> 拜二第一届妈宝评选大赛开幕！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">00:04:26</a> 岛主要求把她妈给她的爱B掉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">00:07:52</a> 阿超：我和我妈情同父子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">00:11:34</a> 妈妈的侠气，都是人命堆出来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">00:15:02</a> HOHO老师用最平和的声音说出最狠的话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">00:30:41</a> 我一句话，改变了我妈的命运</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">00:35:18</a> 「欸，蛮有水平噢」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">00:38:35</a> 我和我妈拜把子的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">00:44:35</a> 论证我妈我爸就是天生一对</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a> 今天这期就是为了这碗醋包的这桌饺子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3502">00:58:22</a> 建议受电诈苦恼的朋友反复收听</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">01:01:45</a> 只有在拜二才会出现的婆媳关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4217">01:10:17</a> 代理阿超妈妈砍价服务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4523">01:15:23</a> 记忆中妈妈的歌声永远都是摇篮曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5755">01:35:55</a> 阿超播客生涯压力最大的时刻</span></p><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>几点（小红书号：5604941853）</span></p><p><span>Rachel47（小红书号：Rachel4747）</span></p><p><span>魔仙岛岛主（小红书号：563249324）</span></p><p><span>阿超（小红书号：679039133）</span></p><p><span>HOHO（小红书号：271794639）</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><h1><span>哎哟妈妈 - 李维敏</span></h1><p><strong><span>出品：</span></strong></p><p><span>南京无名喜剧</span></p><p><strong><span>微信搜索baituole2，加入听友群！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（加入光荣的进化吧！）</span></strong></p><p></p>]]></description>
