    <title>93期：辛夷 | 吃过的教训，都在这了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a67361656a3f3491ba5beaa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a67361656a3f3491ba5beaa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>辛夷这次来啦！程宇、ROSS 还有 蚊香蛙 这次一起聊聊人生吃过的教训！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nm8bOngVBVOVDjj0AvQJlxymvlaq.JPG"><p><strong><span>———————————</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本期中您将听到：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">2:03</a> 纯爱战士ROSS初中情伤一直留到现在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">5:04</a> 这里是ROSS的幻想时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">6:25</a> (ROSS让我删掉这段，我没同意)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 研究生工资竟然拼不过中专！？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 程宇发现爱情的新形态，谈恋爱竟然只谈恋爱？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 不要对学历有滤镜，辛夷发自肺腑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 学习好的学生，其实更变态！？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 精神小妹PUA但蚊香蛙就超爱！？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 程宇爱情故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 程宇为了前女友当众脱衣！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 米饭老师的困惑，辛夷老师为你解惑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a> 点个小数点，ROSS大变800万</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3042">50:42</a> ROSS顾左右而言他大赏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 是什么炒鸡让蚊香蛙念念不忘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3992">66:32</a> 腰缠万贯的瓦哥也有借不出钱的时候</span></p><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>几点（小红书号：5604941853）</span></p><p><span>蚊香蛙（小红书号：蚊香蛙不要进化）</span></p><p><span>ROSS（小红书号：ROSS是罗四）</span></p><p><span>程宇（小红书号：程宇就是成功）</span></p><p><span>辛夷（小红书号：小辛夷夷）</span></p><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><h1><span>Bleeding Gold - Wasia Project</span></h1><p><strong><span>出品：</span></strong></p><p><span>南京无名喜剧</span></p><p><strong><span>微信搜索baituole2，加入听友群！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（加入光荣的进化吧！）</span></strong></p>]]></description>
